    "title": "Social Security COLA Predictions Rise as Inflation Hits a 3-Year High - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Pete Grieve Julia Glum ,\n9 hours ago Social Security recipients are on track for an increased cost-of-living adjustment (COLA) to their benefits next year, forecasters said Wednesday, as inflation soars above 4%. The Senior Citizens League now predicts a 3.8% Social Security COLA for 2027, which would be a 1-percentage-point uptick from this year’s 2.8% adjustment. Read full article",
